digraph callgraph {
  rankdir=LR;
  ranksep=0.6;
  nodesep=0.15;
  label="IMG-OPT-02 Distortion (need distortion info): ANALYSIS call graph (IMG_OPT_02_METIS_AIT_img_cal_distortion_ANALYSIS.py)\nbox = @pipeline_stage, oval = helper, dashed box = class instantiated, dashed arrow = passed as callback; numbers = call order in main(); hover for the full docstring";
